{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFY THE GODS:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633690/extras/22318e9e38eafaaa54e32ff57c4d26e0.poster.avif?t=1769349359\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633690/extras/22318e9e38eafaaa54e32ff57c4d26e0.webm?t=1769349359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633690/extras/22318e9e38eafaaa54e32ff57c4d26e0.mp4?t=1769349359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gods have found themselves a cruel sport! They find a Village and wager on its fate. Watching the innocent trying to survive their relentless onslaught amuses them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Village is given three days and three nights. Every night, a divine Executor descends upon the Village and summons powerful armies with the sole purpose of burning it to the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should the Village stand tall on the dawn of the fourth day, the Gods grow bored, declare the mortals acceptable and move on. Until next time...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with friends in online PvE co-op and become the Protector of the innocent. Repel the divine forces and try to keep your Home (mostly) intact!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is highly replayable as there is no perfect plan. The Protectors must make do with their tools and use the Village grounds as a sprawling sandbox for creative defenses, desperate last stands, and the occasional accidental disaster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one thing matters: the Village must survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stakes may be high, but the spirit is lighthearted. Every match brings its own unpredictable blend of strategy, chaos, and the kind of mishaps that make survival both tense and surprisingly funny. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DAYS IN THE VILLAGE:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633690/extras/6dd9e990412c45a0ae2e34709bab887e.poster.avif?t=1769349359\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633690/extras/6dd9e990412c45a0ae2e34709bab887e.webm?t=1769349359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633690/extras/6dd9e990412c45a0ae2e34709bab887e.mp4?t=1769349359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The days are a race against the clock. Gather resources, raise fortifications, lay down traps, and stock up on equipment, all before the sun sets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every moment counts, and even the best-laid plans can feel like a frantic sprint when good defenses are the difference between annihilation and survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NIGHTS IN THE VILLAGE:<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633690/extras/b61966915c8dd5f85a3d23e23a84409b.poster.avif?t=1769349359\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633690/extras/b61966915c8dd5f85a3d23e23a84409b.webm?t=1769349359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633690/extras/b61966915c8dd5f85a3d23e23a84409b.mp4?t=1769349359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night fall, the Village braces for chaos as Divine Executors arrive with their mighty armies, unleashing wave after wave until dawn arrives\u2026 or until the Village is nothing but ashes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repel the invaders however you can: walls, traps, teamwork and just a dash of desperation. The Village must survive, and if it does, it\u2019ll be one hell of story worth bragging about!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633690?t=1769349359","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633690/15aac0a8bfba6d3c6d2c5048479074825bb90479/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769349359","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633690/f5737e8fcbf5a278b954b451b41933993e545503/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769349359","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633690/f5737e8fcbf5a278b954b451b41933993e545503/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769349359","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFY THE GODS:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633690/extras/22318e9e38eafaaa54e32ff57c4d26e0.poster.avif?t=1769349359\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste