speration. The Village must survive, and if it does, it\u2019ll be one hell of story worth bragging about!</p>","developers":["Gazing Pup"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633690/0f87fe7f6cdf014dac68eceb01df0f4f0e326c0c/header.jpg?t=1769349359","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3633690/1244061868/be39919b23d79ed9033ced6971b32df49391568d/1762452176/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762452878","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3633690/1244061868/be39919b23d79ed9033ced6971b32df49391568d/1762452176/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762452878","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3633690/1244061868/be39919b23d79ed9033ced6971b32df49391568d/1762452176/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762452878","id":257227818,"name":"Protector Gameplay Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257227818/57a085267a0d36153399ee1f9aa2f5a45c69e435/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762452878"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3633690/759504050/f0d161df0517283298b9baf8618747482cbcbe38/1761411917/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761478714","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3633690/759504050/f0d161df0517283298b9baf8618747482cbcbe38/1761411917/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761478714","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3633690/759504050/f0d161df0517283298b9baf8618747482cbcbe38/1761411917/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761478714","id":257222503,"name":"Protector Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257222503/975bb3c610afb6c084d69180b45b56831b9cb4cb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761478714"}],"name":"Divine Gambit","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><